<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ-ώστρα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stage-machine</i> identified with
			the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκύκλημα</span> (q. v.) by <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.127
			</span></i>, but distd. from it, ib.<i><span class="en">
				129
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τύχης ἐπὶ τὴν ἐ. ἀναβιβαζούσης
					τὴν ὑμετέραν ἄγνοιαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.5.8
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξ-ωστρον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).199
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				95
			</span></i> (pl., Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bridge thrust out</i> from the besiegers' tower against the
			walls of the besieged place, Lat. <i>exostra,</i> Veget.<i>de Re
				Milit.</i><i><span class="en">
				4.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>balcony,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>; = Lat. <i>maenianum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
